@startuml
title P1 macOS integrated capture and local self-test

actor User
component "Pulsar shell\nwindow + status menu" as Shell
component "MacCaptureAppComposition\napp lifecycle + projection" as App
component "MacRecordingShortcutLifecycle\nCarbon bounded presets" as Shortcut
component "MacCaptureWorkflowController\nsingle operation gate" as Workflow
component "MacMicrophoneCaptureEngine\nTCC + CoreAudio + bounded WAV" as Capture
component "MacLocalSelfTestService\nexact 5 seconds + file intake" as SelfTest
component "MacProductionLocalClipOutput\nproduction overlay mixer" as Output
database "CaptureMediaStore\nprivate partials + drafts" as Store
component "AudioEngine\naccountless or paired graph" as Audio

User --> Shell
Shortcut --> Workflow : toggle/cancel
Shell --> App : typed actions
App --> Workflow
Workflow --> Capture : one owner at a time
Workflow --> SelfTest : local-only actions/events
Capture --> Store
SelfTest --> Store
Workflow --> Output : serialized cues
SelfTest --> Output : cue + completed self-test
Output --> Audio

note bottom of Workflow
No coordinator, upload, transmission,
fetch or network client in this boundary.
end note
@enduml
